<p>HAIN DONO AALAM ME SHORE GIRYA RASOOL DUNIYA SE JA RAHE HAI...</p>

<p>Hai dono aalam me shore girya Rasool duniya se ja rahe hai,<br>
Hai Anbiya masruf e buka sab, malak bhi ansu baha rahe hai.</p>

<p>Hai ghair haal aj Murtuza ka, hua hai saneha Mustafa ka,<br>
Qaleel e Kaaba hai sar barehna qadam bhi kuch dagmaga rahe hai.</p>

<p>Yeh kaisa gham hai, har aankh nam hai, jhukaye sar ko shahe umam hai,<br>
Hassan ko apne jigar ke tukde nazar abhi se hi aa rahe hai.</p>

<p>Rahe na sunkar Rasul e Akram hai Fatima par ghashi ka aalam,<br>
Hussain apne tasavvuro'n me abhi se maqtal ko pa rahe hai.</p>

<p>Na ho pareshan tu aye 'Mehshar' yeh keh rahi hai Nabi ki duqtar,<br>
Hussain par mere rone wale, ja teri qismat bana rahe hai...</p>